<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" class="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>일본 경마 완벽 가이드 대시보드 | JRA & 명마 도감</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        darkBg: '#0b0f19',
                        darkCard: '#131b2e',
                        darkBorder: '#1e293b',
                        gold: '#f59e0b',
                        jraGreen: '#10b981',
                        accentBlue: '#3b82f6'
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <!-- Chart.js -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <!-- Leaflet CSS & JS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" />
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js"></script>
    <!-- Font Awesome -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/static/pretendard.css');
        * { font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; }
        .gradient-text {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #ef4444 50%, #8b5cf6 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .tab-btn.active {
            border-bottom: 3px solid #3b82f6;
            color: #3b82f6;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-darkBg text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 min-h-screen transition-colors duration-200">

    <!-- 상단 네비게이션 헤더 -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white/90 dark:bg-darkCard/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder shadow-sm">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <span class="text-3xl">🏇</span>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold gradient-text">일본 경마 올인원 대시보드</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">JRA 중앙경마 10대 구장 · G1 캘린더 · 명마 도감 · 베팅 가이드</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                <button id="themeToggle" class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-yellow-400 hover:ring-2 hover:ring-blue-500 transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-moon dark:hidden"></i>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-sun hidden dark:inline"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 탭 메뉴 바 -->
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex space-x-2 sm:space-x-6 overflow-x-auto text-sm font-medium border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/60">
            <button onclick="switchTab('tab1')" id="btn-tab1" class="tab-btn active py-3 px-2 flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap"><i class="fa-solid fa-crown text-amber-500"></i>최애마 설정</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('tab2')" id="btn-tab2" class="tab-btn py-3 px-2 flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><i class="fa-solid fa-fire text-red-500"></i>G1 레이스 일정</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('tab3')" id="btn-tab3" class="tab-btn py-3 px-2 flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><i class="fa-solid fa-horse text-blue-500"></i>명마 & 기수 도감</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('tab4')" id="btn-tab4" class="tab-btn py-3 px-2 flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><i class="fa-solid fa-map-location-dot text-emerald-500"></i>전국 10대 경마장</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('tab5')" id="btn-tab5" class="tab-btn py-3 px-2 flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><i class="fa-solid fa-ticket text-purple-500"></i>마권 종류 & 계산기</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('tab6')" id="btn-tab6" class="tab-btn py-3 px-2 flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><i class="fa-solid fa-trophy text-yellow-500"></i>명예의 전당 & 뉴스</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 메인 컨텐츠 영역 -->
    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">

        <!-- [TAB 1] 최애마 설정 -->
        <section id="tab1" class="tab-content">
            <div class="mb-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 bg-white dark:bg-darkCard p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder shadow-sm">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span>👑 나의 최애 경주마 설정</span>
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">원하는 명마를 선택하면 상세 스펙과 커리어 하이라이트가 즉시 반영됩니다.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <select id="horseSelect" class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 font-medium text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500">
                        <option value="이퀴녹스" selected>이퀴녹스 (Equinox)</option>
                        <option value="딥 임팩트">딥 임팩트 (Deep Impact)</option>
                        <option value="아몬드 아이">아몬드 아이 (Almond Eye)</option>
                        <option value="오르페브르">오르페브르 (Orfevre)</option>
                        <option value="키타산 블랙">키타산 블랙 (Kitasan Black)</option>
                        <option value="골드 쉽">골드 쉽 (Gold Ship)</option>
                        <option value="사일런스 스즈카">사일런스 스즈카 (Silence Suzuka)</option>
                        <option value="토카이 테이오">토카이 테이오 (Tokai Teio)</option>
                        <option value="소다시">소다시 (Sodashi)</option>
                        <option value="도듀스">도듀스 (Do Deuce)</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
                <!-- 말 프로필 카드 -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white dark:bg-darkCard p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span id="horseBadge" class="px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-500 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">세계 레이팅 135의 괴물</span>
                        <span id="horseCoat" class="text-xs text-slate-400">청록모 (青鹿毛)</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold mt-3" id="horseName">이퀴녹스 <span class="text-base text-slate-400 font-normal">(イクイノックス)</span></h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1" id="horseBasic">2019년생 | 수말 (牡) | 기무라 데쓰야 마방</p>

                    <hr class="my-4 border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm">
                        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/40 rounded-xl">
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">각질 (주행 스타일)</span>
                            <p class="font-bold text-blue-500 mt-0.5" id="horseStyle">선행 / 선입 (自在)</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/40 rounded-xl">
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">적성 거리</span>
                            <p class="font-bold text-emerald-500 mt-0.5" id="horseDist">2,000m ~ 2,410m</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/40 rounded-xl">
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">통산 전적</span>
                            <p class="font-bold mt-0.5" id="horseRecord">10전 8승 [8-2-0-0]</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/40 rounded-xl">
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">총 수득 상금</span>
                            <p class="font-bold text-amber-500 mt-0.5" id="horseMoney">22억 1,544만 엔</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/40 rounded-xl text-sm">
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">🧬 혈통 정보</p>
                        <p id="horsePedigree">부: <strong>키타산 블랙</strong> × 모: <strong>샤토 블랑슈</strong> (모부: 킹 헤일로)</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-amber-500/5 border-l-4 border-amber-500 rounded-r-xl">
                        <p class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-500 mb-1">📖 명승부 스토리</p>
                        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300" id="horseStory">
                            2023년 두바이 시마 클래식에서 코스 레코드로 압승. 텐노상(가을)에서 1분 55초 2 세계 레코드를 수립하며 론진 세계 랭킹 1위로 은퇴했습니다.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 능력치 레이더 차트 & G1 승리 목록 -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white dark:bg-darkCard p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-radar text-blue-500"></i> 6각 능력치 레이더 분석
                        </h4>
                        <div class="relative h-64">
                            <canvas id="horseRadarChart"></canvas>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-400 mb-2">🏆 주요 G1 우승 타이틀</h4>
                        <div id="horseG1List" class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                            <!-- JS로 삽입 -->
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- [TAB 2] G1 레이스 일정 -->
        <section id="tab2" class="tab-content hidden">
            <div class="mb-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 bg-white dark:bg-darkCard p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder shadow-sm">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span>🔥 JRA 연간 전체 G1 레이스 캘린더</span>
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">2월 페브러리S부터 12월 아리마 기념/호프풀S까지 24개 최고봉 레이스 총정리</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex gap-2">
                    <select id="raceSurfaceFilter" class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium">
                        <option value="all">전체 마장</option>
                        <option value="turf">잔디 (Turf)</option>
                        <option value="dirt">더트 (Dirt)</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="g1RaceGrid" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <!-- JS로 동적 생성 -->
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- [TAB 3] 명마 & 기수 도감 -->
        <section id="tab3" class="tab-content hidden">
            <!-- 1:1 비교 섹션 -->
            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-darkCard p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder shadow-sm mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced text-blue-500"></i> 두 경주마 1:1 스펙 가상 대결 비교
                </h3>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
                    <div>
                        <label class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-semibold mb-1 block">말 A (파랑)</label>
                        <select id="compareA" class="w-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 font-medium text-sm">
                            <!-- JS populate -->
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-semibold mb-1 block">말 B (빨강)</label>
                        <select id="compareB" class="w-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 font-medium text-sm">
                            <!-- JS populate -->
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="relative h-80">
                    <canvas id="compareRadarChart"></canvas>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 기수 섹션 -->
            <div class="mt-8">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user-astronaut text-purple-500"></i> 일본 경마 레전드 & 톱 기수(Jockey) 열전
                </h3>
                <div id="jockeyGrid" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                    <!-- JS populate -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- [TAB 4] 전국 10대 경마장 -->
        <section id="tab4" class="tab-content hidden">
            <div class="mb-6 bg-white dark:bg-darkCard p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder shadow-sm">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">🏟️ JRA 전국 10대 중앙 경마장 가이드 & 인터랙티브 지도</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">경마장을 클릭하면 위치와 코스 고저차, 최종 직선 길이 및 공략법을 상세히 분석합니다.</p>
                <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" id="trackButtons">
                    <!-- JS buttons -->
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
                <!-- 지도 -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white dark:bg-darkCard p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder shadow-sm">
                    <div id="map" class="w-full h-[450px] rounded-xl z-10"></div>
                </div>
                <!-- 경마장 정보 -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white dark:bg-darkCard p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between" id="trackDetailBox">
                    <!-- JS populate -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- [TAB 5] 마권 종류 & 계산기 -->
        <section id="tab5" class="tab-content hidden">
            <!-- 배당금 계산기 카드 -->
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-900/40 via-indigo-900/20 to-purple-900/40 border border-blue-500/30 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold flex items-center gap-2 text-blue-400 mb-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-calculator"></i> 실시간 마권 환급금 & 수익률 계산기
                </h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-6">마권 종류와 베팅 금액, 배당률을 입력하면 당첨 시 예상 수령액과 순수익, 원화 환산액을 즉시 계산합니다.</p>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
                    <div>
                        <label class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium mb-1 block">마권 종류</label>
                        <select id="calcBetType" class="w-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-sm">
                            <option>단승 (単勝)</option>
                            <option>연승 / 복승식 (複勝)</option>
                            <option>복연승 / 와이드 (ワイド)</option>
                            <option>마번복승 / 우마렌 (馬連)</option>
                            <option>마번쌍승 / 우마탄 (馬単)</option>
                            <option>3연복 (3連複)</option>
                            <option>3연단 (3連単)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium mb-1 block">베팅 금액 (엔, ¥)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="calcAmount" value="1000" min="100" step="100" class="w-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium mb-1 block">확정 배당률 (배)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="calcOdds" value="3.5" min="1.0" step="0.1" class="w-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/70 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 text-center">
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">총 베팅액</span>
                        <p class="text-lg font-bold mt-1 text-slate-200" id="resCost">¥1,000</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/70 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 text-center">
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">예상 환급금 (엔)</span>
                        <p class="text-xl font-extrabold mt-1 text-emerald-400" id="resPayout">¥3,500</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/70 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 text-center">
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">순수익 (엔)</span>
                        <p class="text-xl font-extrabold mt-1 text-amber-400" id="resProfit">+¥2,500</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/70 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 text-center">
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">원화 예상액</span>
                        <p class="text-lg font-bold mt-1 text-purple-400" id="resKrw">약 31,850원</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 마권 10가지 정리 -->
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check text-blue-500"></i> 일본 경마 10가지 마권 완전 정복
            </h3>
            <div id="betTypesGrid" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
                <!-- JS populate -->
            </div>

            <!-- 파독 및 마장 상태 -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <div class="bg-white dark:bg-darkCard p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder shadow-sm">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-base mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-500">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-eye"></i> 실전 파독(Paddock) 관찰 5대 비법
                    </h4>
                    <div id="paddockList" class="space-y-3">
                        <!-- JS populate -->
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white dark:bg-darkCard p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder shadow-sm">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-base mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-500">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-showers-heavy"></i> 마장 상태(바바) 4단계와 영향
                    </h4>
                    <div id="trackCondList" class="space-y-3">
                        <!-- JS populate -->
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- [TAB 6] 명예의 전당 & 뉴스 -->
        <section id="tab6" class="tab-content hidden">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
                <!-- 상금 랭킹 -->
                <div class="bg-white dark:bg-darkCard p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder shadow-sm">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-500">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-sack-dollar"></i> 역대 수득 상금 랭킹 TOP 8
                    </h3>
                    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                        <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
                            <thead class="text-xs text-slate-400 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="py-2">순위</th>
                                    <th class="py-2">경주마</th>
